e vertrouwde stad anders laat bekijken en vragen oproept over wat er onder haar oppervlak gebeurt.","work_id":978100109,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1957805/grondwerk.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789025475598 verschijningsdatum 10/06/2025 NUR 300 Literaire fictie algemeen 301 Literaire roman, novelle imprint Atlas Contact uitgever Atlas Contact, Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sha256":"c421634652968b0b80cdf27111bdd556cac105c1086c06fc49608be03b6f92b4","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:43:14.133Z","sourceAuthors":"Tijl Nuyts"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1957805/grondwerk.html","fact":"Work-bound content reviewed; original factual Dutch summary, not source quotation or title-derived content.","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1957805/grondwerk.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32+00:00","source_name":"Bibliografische bron; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-08-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":978300052},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":978100110},"seq":13,"relation":"works","after_row":{"id":978100110,"title":"Als de dieren","cover_id":null,"author_id":978300053,"work_type":null,"source_type":"lumiscore_native","open_library_id":null,"first_publish_year":null,"native_identity_key":"nl-reviewed-isbn:9789493320833"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":978200168},"seq":14,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":978200168,"title":"Als de dieren","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789493320833","work_id":978100110,"cover_id":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Das Mag Uitgeverij B.V.","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":null},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":978200168},"seq":15,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"paperback","work_id":978100110,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1802715/als-de-dieren.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789493320833 verschijningsdatum 17/04/2025 NUR 301 Literaire roman, novelle imprint Das Mag Uitgeverij B.V. uitgever Das Mag Uitgeverij B.V. taal Nederlands","sha256":"523ea425ae14d3f7afeaa187b69761bd4681954bb1ec385b742355d6d124550d","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:43:16.277Z","sourceAuthors":"Lieselot Mariën"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000733067_Als_de_dieren_0_0.jpg","fact":"Exact edition block and human visual review; same observed provider image stem for medium variant.","bytes":148696,"sha256":"a8bd0fcb705777c765cc304080697f69102eb20ae9c759c46ced8c78a672f035","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:23:59.897Z"},{"url":"https://www.randkrant.be/artikels/auteur-lieselot-marien-schrijft-als-de-dieren-domweg-gelukkig-in-relegem","fact":"Author interview about new-mother experience and this novel; not just a bibliographic description.","checkedAt":"2026-11-01"},{"url":"https://www.flandersliterature.be/books-and-authors/book/the-animals-within","fact":"Official Flanders Literature rights catalogue independently confirms the post-partum crisis, dual perspective and animal imagery; Das Mag exact ISBN9789493320833 confirms identity. Randkrant author interview retained as supporting evidence.","checkedAt":"2026-11-02"}],"cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000733067_Als_de_dieren_0_0.jpg","edition_id":978200168,"bound_title":"Als de dieren","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789493320833","evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1802715/als-de-dieren.html","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-08-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"nld","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":978300053},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":978100110,"language":"nl"},"seq":16,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Na de geboorte van haar kind probeert een vrouw grip te krijgen op een werkelijkheid die niet meer vertrouwd aanvoelt. Het moederschap brengt haar niet de vanzelfsprekende zekerheid die zij had verwacht. Haar gedachten en ervaringen vallen uiteen in verschillende perspectieven, waarin ook beelden uit de dierenwereld een plaats krijgen. De roman onderzoekt de afstand tussen de verwachtingen rond een nieuwe moeder en wat zij zelf kan ervaren en verwoorden.","work_id":978100110,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1802715/als-de-dieren.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789493320833 verschijningsdatum 17/04/2025 NUR 301 Literaire roman, novelle imprint Das Mag Uitgeverij B.V. uitgever Das Mag Uitgeverij B.V. taal Nederlands","sha256":"523ea425ae14d3f7afeaa187b69761bd4681954bb1ec385b742355d6d124550d","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T20:43:16.277Z","sourceAuthors":"Lieselot Mariën"},{"url":"https://www.flandersliterature.be/books-and-authors/book/the-animals-within","fact":"Work-bound content reviewed; original factual Dutch summary, not source quotation or title-derived content.","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T21:37:32Z"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://www.flandersliterature.be/books-and-authors/book/the-animals-within","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T21:37:32+00:00","source_name":"Bibliografische bron; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl007-reviewed-batch-08-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":978300053},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":978100111},"seq":17,"relation":"works","after_row":{"id":978100111,"title":"De rode koe","cover_id":null,"author_id":978300054,"work_type":null,"source_type":"lumiscore_native","open_library_id":null,"first_publish_year":null,"native_identity_key":"nl-reviewed-isbn:9789044545395"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":978200169},"seq":18,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":978200169,"title":"De rode koe","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789044545395","work_id":978100111,"cover_id":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"De Geus","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":null},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":9